  "permlink": "https://cafe.daum.net/sedu22/KIr/2092",
  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">올해는 유네스코가 정한</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">세계 양자과학 기술의 해입니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size18\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">1925년 베르너 하이젠베르크의 양자과학 시작으로 </span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">주요 양자역학의 발견 </span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">100주년을 기념하는 해가 2025년입니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">그래서 전세계적으로</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">양자역학 관련된 많은 행사를 기획하고 있어요.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\">2005년 &#39;기적의해 100주년&#39; 행사를 했던것 처럼요.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\" data-ke-size=\"size18\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Year_of_Quantum_Science_and_Technology\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Year_of_Quantum_Science_and_Technology</a></span></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"International Year of Quantum Science and Technology - Wikipedia\" data-og-description=\"From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia International Year of Quantum Science and Technology 2025International Year of Quantum logoDate1&#160;January&#160;&#8211; 31&#160;December&#160;2025&#160;(2025-01-01&#160;&#8211; 2025-12-31)TypeExhibitionsWebsitequantum2025.org The&#8239;International Y\" data-og-host=\"en.wikipedia.org\" data-og-source-url=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Year_of_Quantum_Science_and_Technology\" data-og-url=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Year_of_Quantum_Science_and_Technology\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/joaaw/hyX7OUSmV9/SwDL3uD5okcsZlIlig5Gz0/img.png?width=319&amp;height=312&amp;face=0_0_319_312,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cSbHQw/hyX7SJSPZm/cr9IwA8V4YdZheO0jwzNtk/img.png?width=319&amp;height=312&amp;face=0_0_319_312,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/E9exk/hyYb7efAWI/aN9XkkouMKECLGsJRPJFU1/img.png?width=240&amp;height=235&amp;face=0_0_240_235\"><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Year_of_Quantum_Science_and_Technology\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/International_Year_of_Quantum_Science_and_Technology\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/joaaw/hyX7OUSmV9/SwDL3uD5okcsZlIlig5Gz0/img.png?width=319&amp;height=312&amp;face=0_0_319_312,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cSbHQw/hyX7SJSPZm/cr9IwA8V4YdZheO0jwzNtk/img.png?width=319&amp;height=312&amp;face=0_0_319_312,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/E9exk/hyYb7efAWI/aN9XkkouMKECLGsJRPJFU1/img.png?width=240&amp;height=235&amp;face=0_0_240_235\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">International Year of Quantum Science and Technology - Wikipedia</p><p class=\"og-desc\">From Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia International Year of Quantum Science and Technology 2025International Year of Quantum logoDate1&#160;January&#160;&#8211; 31&#160;December&#160;2025&#160;(2025-01-01&#160;&#8211; 2025-12-31)TypeExhibitionsWebsitequantum2025.org The&#8239;International Y</p><p class=\"og-host\">en.wikipedia.org</p></div></a></div><p><a href=\"https://quantum2025.org/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://quantum2025.org/</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"IYQ 2025\" data-og-description=\"The 2025 International Year of Quantum Science and Technology (IYQ) recognizes 100 years since the initial development of quantum mechanics.\" data-og-host=\"quantum2025.org\" data-og-source-url=\"https://quantum2025.org/\" data-og-url=\"https://quantum2025.org/\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/c6zefQ/hyX73R9FIU/7GNucNy0y4NVJWkTRb9hE1/img.jpg?width=1920&amp;height=1080&amp;face=0_0_1920_1080,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/HWPnG/hyX7TBUave/1lW3WKko3NG20ks7Aje450/img.jpg?width=509&amp;height=339&amp;face=0_0_509_339,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/boJRw2/hyYb7rMM2m/QwjiAPQcOYRHeyBEg8QXVK/img.jpg?width=509&amp;height=339&amp;face=0_0_509_339\"><a href=\"https://quantum2025.org/\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://quantum2025.org/\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/c6zefQ/hyX73R9FIU/7GNucNy0y4NVJWkTRb9hE1/img.jpg?width=1920&amp;height=1080&amp;face=0_0_1920_1080,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/HWPnG/hyX7TBUave/1lW3WKko3NG20ks7Aje450/img.jpg?width=509&amp;height=339&amp;face=0_0_509_339,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/boJRw2/hyYb7rMM2m/QwjiAPQcOYRHeyBEg8QXVK/img.jpg?width=509&amp;height=339&amp;face=0_0_509_339\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">IYQ 2025</p><p class=\"og-desc\">The 2025 International Year of Quantum Science and Technology (IYQ) recognizes 100 years since the initial development of quantum mechanics.</p><p class=\"og-host\">quantum2025.org</p></div></a></div><p><a href=\"https://www.kps.or.kr/content/community/post_view.php?bt=2&amp;post_id=3714\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.kps.or.kr/content/community/post_view.php?bt=2&amp;post_id=3714</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"한국물리학회\" data-og-description=\"글쓴이와 관리자만 접근할 수 있습니다. 글 등록 시 입력한 비밀번호를 입력해 주세요.\" data-og-host=\"www.kps.or.kr\" data-og-source-url=\"https://www.kps.or.kr/content/community/post_view.php?bt=2&amp;post_id=3714\" data-og-url=\"https://www.kps.or.kr/content/community/post_view.php?bt=2&amp;post_id=3714\" data-og-image=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\"><a href=\"https://www.kps.or.kr/content/community/post_view.php?bt=2&amp;post_id=3714\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://www.kps.or.kr/content/community/post_view.php?bt=2&amp;post_id=3714\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">한국물리학회</p><p class=\"og-desc\">글쓴이와 관리자만 접근할 수 있습니다. 글 등록 시 입력한 비밀번호를 입력해 주세요.</p><p class=\"og-host\">www.kps.or.kr</p></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ecdbd3e4cda12c1e0c32a2fbd722cc966ab1bf81\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ecdbd3e4cda12c1e0c32a2fbd722cc966ab1bf81\" data-origin-width=\"796\" data-origin-height=\"1125\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>그래서</p><p>올해 저희학교 교내에서도</p><p>양자역학 관련한 행사를 하면 좋겠다는 생각을</p><p>작년부터 꾸준히 하고 있어요^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p>양자역학의 상수들이 몇 개가 있어요.</p><p>그 중 가장 대표적인 상수가 &#39;플랑크 상수&#39;에요.</p><p><a href=\"https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%94%8C%EB%9E%91%ED%81%AC_%EC%83%81%EC%88%98\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%94%8C%EB%9E%91%ED%81%AC_%EC%83%81%EC%88%98</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"플랑크 상수 - 위키백과, 우리 모두의 백과사전\" data-og-description=\"위키백과, 우리 모두의 백과사전. 플랑크 상수 h {\\displaystyle h} 종류: 물리 상수 값: 6.626 070 15&#160;× 10&#8722;34 J·s 출처: CODATA 2018[1] 디랙 상수 &#8463; = h / 2 π {\\displaystyle \\hbar =h/{2\\pi }} 종류: 물리 상수 값: 1.054\" data-og-host=\"ko.wikipedia.org\" data-og-source-url=\"https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%94%8C%EB%9E%91%ED%81%AC_%EC%83%81%EC%88%98\" data-og-url=\"https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%94%8C%EB%9E%91%ED%81%AC_%EC%83%81%EC%88%98\" data-og-image=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/AlAac/hyYciz4Ssx/CkQ6rBPOfSAipa70HLVkS1/img.jpg?width=256&amp;height=153&amp;face=0_0_256_153,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/AjGqL/hyX7Ut8uKr/9Kkrjjyzk2ulkXHG9KC9sK/img.jpg?width=256&amp;height=153&amp;face=0_0_256_153\"><a href=\"https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%94%8C%EB%9E%91%ED%81%AC_%EC%83%81%EC%88%98\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://ko.wikipedia.org/wiki/%ED%94%8C%EB%9E%91%ED%81%AC_%EC%83%81%EC%88%98\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/AlAac/hyYciz4Ssx/CkQ6rBPOfSAipa70HLVkS1/img.jpg?width=256&amp;height=153&amp;face=0_0_256_153,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/AjGqL/hyX7Ut8uKr/9Kkrjjyzk2ulkXHG9KC9sK/img.jpg?width=256&amp;height=153&amp;face=0_0_256_153\" alt=\"\" xxxxonerror=\"this.src=&quot;//img1.kakaocdn.net/thumb/C200x200/?fname=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafe_image%2Fcafe_meta_image_190529.png&quot;\"></div><div class=\"og-text\"><p class=\"og-title\">플랑크 상수 - 위키백과, 우리 모두의 백과사전</p><p class=\"og-desc\">위키백과, 우리 모두의 백과사전. 플랑크 상수 h {\\displaystyle h} 종류: 물리 상수 값: 6.626 070 15&#160;× 10&#8722;34 J·s 출처: CODATA 2018[1] 디랙 상수 &#8463; = h / 2 π {\\displaystyle \\hbar =h/{2\\pi }} 종류: 물리 상수 값: 1.054</p><p class=\"og-host\">ko.wikipedia.org</p></div></a></div><p>플랑크 상수가</p><p>6.62 ~ 이렇게 시작하니까</p><p>6월6일에 할까? 이런 생각들요.</p><p>(학생들 각자 집에서 무엇인가를 하는거죠)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>행사 내용은 미정이고요;;;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>함께 같이 추진해보실 선생님? ^^</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
